  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "en",
      "_type": "object",
      "value": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000001",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000000",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Discovering the Charm of Rosetta (Rasheed)"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000005",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000003",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000002"
              ],
              "text": "Rosetta"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", or Rasheed as it’s locally known, is a town where the past and present intertwine in a captivating dance. A stroll along its Corniche offers a window into both its historical grandeur and its current vibrancy, making it an essential experience for any visitor."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rosetta_(Egipto)",
              "newTab": true
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000007",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "A Walk Down Memory Lane on the Corniche"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000009",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The Corniche, a testament to Rosetta’s former elegance, may have lost some of its past grandeur, but it still holds a charm that is uniquely its own. A leisurely walk here is more than just a physical journey; it’s a step back in time, allowing you to soak in the atmosphere of a bygone era. The path, lined with reminders of its rich history, offers a serene escape from the hustle and bustle of modern life."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Nature's Display: The Nile in Its Final Journey"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000010",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Depending on the time of your visit, the Corniche presents two distinct yet equally mesmerizing spectacles. In the bright light of day, you can witness the Nile, majestic and serene, on one of its final sojourns towards the Mediterranean Sea. This sight is not just visually stunning but also evokes a sense of the timeless journey of this great river, which has been the lifeline of "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000d"
              ],
              "text": "Egypt"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " for millennia."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "http://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viajes-de-egipto/",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000012",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "A Colorful Fleet: The Joy of Fishing Boats"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000014",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000013",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "As the day gives way to the evening, the scene transforms. The Corniche becomes a vibrant display of large fishing boats, painted in joyful hues of blue and green, bobbing gently on the water. This lively panorama is not just a feast for the eyes but also a glimpse into the town’s enduring relationship with the sea. The boats, with their bright colors and bustling activity, are a reminder of the town’s rich maritime heritage and the simple joys of life by the water."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000015",
          "_pendingImage": "https://travel2egypt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Rosetta-Egypt.jpg",
          "_type": "image",
          "alt": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "A white mosque with a golden minaret by the water's edge at sunset, with people gathered nearby"
            }
          ],
          "caption": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Evening tranquility embraces the Suez waterfront as the day concludes in prayerful silence."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000016",
          "_pendingImage": "https://travel2egypt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/que-ver-en-rosetta.jpg",
          "_type": "image",
          "alt": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "A photo depicting two boats on the shore of a waterway with an ornate building in the background, under a clear sky"
            }
          ],
          "caption": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "The tranquil beauty of the Rosetta Riverbank, where ships dock and history stands tall"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "es",
      "_type": "object",
      "value": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000001",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000000",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Descubrir el encanto de Rosetta (Rasheed)"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000007",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000003",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000002"
              ],
              "text": "Rosetta"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", o Rasheed como se la conoce localmente, es una ciudad donde el pasado y el presente se entrelazan en una danza cautivadora."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000005",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Un paseo por su Corniche ofrece una ventana tanto a su grandeza histórica como a su vitalidad actual, lo que la convierte en una experiencia esencial para cualquier visitante."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rosetta_(Egipto)",
              "newTab": true
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000009",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Un paseo por los recuerdos en la Corniche"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000012",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "La Corniche, testimonio de la antigua elegancia de Rosetta, puede haber perdido parte de su pasada grandeza, pero aún conserva un encanto que le es propio."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Un paseo tranquilo por aquí es algo más que un recorrido físico; es un paso atrás en el tiempo, que te permite empaparte "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000d"
              ],
              "text": "de la"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " atmósfera de una época pasada."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "El camino, bordeado de recuerdos de su rica historia, ofrece una escapada serena del ajetreo y el bullicio de la vida moderna."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-de-guiza/la-mastaba-de-ptahshepses-en-abusir/",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000014",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000013",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "El Despliegue de la Naturaleza: El Nilo en su Viaje Final"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000023",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Dependiendo de la hora de tu "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000016"
              ],
              "text": "visita"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000018",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", la Corniche presenta dos espectáculos distintos pero igualmente fascinantes."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "A la luz del día, puedes contemplar "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000001b"
              ],
              "text": "el Nilo"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", majestuoso y sereno, en uno de sus últimos viajes hacia el Mediterráneo."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Este espectáculo no sólo es visualmente asombroso, sino que también evoca la sensación del viaje intemporal de este gran río, que ha sido el sustento de "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000021",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000020"
              ],
              "text": "Egipto"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000022",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " durante milenios."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/vacaciones-inolvidables-en-egipto/",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001b",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/el-nil-elegance-crucero-de-7-dias-dahabiya-por-el-nilo/",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000020",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "http://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viajes-de-egipto/",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000025",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000024",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Una flota de colores: La alegría de los barcos de pesca"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000036",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000026",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "A medida "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000028",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000027"
              ],
              "text": "que el día"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000029",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " da paso al atardecer, la escena se transforma."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "La Corniche se convierte en un vibrante despliegue de grandes barcos pesqueros, pintados en alegres tonos azules y verdes, que se mecen suavemente en el agua."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Este animado panorama no es "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000002e"
              ],
              "text": "sólo un festín para los"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000030",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " ojos, sino también un atisbo de la duradera relación de la ciudad con el mar."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000031",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000032",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Los barcos, con sus brillantes colores y su bulliciosa actividad, son un recordatorio "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000034",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000033"
              ],
              "text": "del rico patrimonio"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000035",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " marítimo de la ciudad y de la sencilla alegría de vivir junto al agua."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000027",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/horario-y-dias-festivos/",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002e",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/el-tiempo-en-egipto/",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000033",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-del-oasis-de-bahariya/sabores-del-oasis-degustacion-del-patrimonio-culinario-del-oasis-de-bahariya/",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
